    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpĕrātrix</span></b> ,
			īcis, f.
		operator, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>she that works</i>, <i>a worker</i>,
				<i>effecter</i>, <i>producer</i>
			(eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vis operatrix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Anim. 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mortis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sapientia,</span>”
				<i>creative wisdom</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Spir. Sanc. 2, 9, §
				92</span></i>
			.</div>
